    <string name="alerts_hint">Tap the icon beside a time to choose what the phone does when it arrives: nothing, a notification or a full-screen notice, and with a sound, a vibration or silently. The full-screen notice is black with the clock time, over the lock screen too; on a phone in use it is a banner. None of this is the alarm: Fajr has the alarm.</string>
