    <string name="ends_hint">Asr\'s time lasts until Maghrib and Isha\'s until Fajr. The schools differ on the point inside it after which delaying the prayer is disliked, or is only for someone with an excuse. Choose the one you follow: the list and the widgets show it as the end, and the prayer stays the current one until its time is over. Check the choice with a scholar you trust.</string>
